              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Petitioners argue that the Medicare Secondary Payer Act requires a group health plan to pay its benefits first for a 30\u2011month coordination period and not to consider Medicare eligibility or differentiate benefits based on an ESRD diagnosis."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioners",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
